(text "U1: user-installed TENSTAR / compatible nRF52840 module.\nModule USB-C faces the rear case opening directly; no extension cable.\n21 GPIO: 20 matrix + BL_EN. P0.09/P0.10 configured as GPIO.\nNo tall sockets; mechanical model defines mounting envelope.\nBattery/charger and exact clone remain subject to bench validation." (at 30.48 210.82 0)
